{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"698489628289925130","content":"Lt Pandy gathers as many of you together as possible and reveals some disturbing news to you.\n\"It's worse than I thought. I apologize for distancing myself from you, but given current difficulties, it has been unavoidable. Besides our little incident, you have conducted yourselves magnificently. I am confident that you will prevail in this farce of a trial. As unpleasant as that is, I must first explain a bit more, and then ask more of you. \n\n\"First, we are at war. The other factions have put plans into motions that must be stopped. Those fools think they know what they are doing, but it is folly. They are playing with powers too large for them, and they will destroy the world if they are not careful. For now let me just say that they are uncovering items of power. Some of these are inconsequential to our goals, but others...others are very necessary. \n\n\"The Knights du roi soleil have been acquiring artifacts. If you find any of these, bring them to me. But not until we arrive at our destination. Keep them save until then. I know they have some in their possession even now. We will get those eventually. But tonight they have unwittingly stumbled up on one. Should any of them return alive, I need you to acquire a bag of holding for me. It is...special. I will reimburse you up to 500 gold if you can get it for me. Try not to let anyone know that you are collecting these. We have many to gather, and very little time to do it. This is the first, but there will be more. We are entering powerful and ancient waters. More will be revealed at the appropriate time.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T06:10:01.761000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737552427431231559","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
